===Etymology===
From Dr. [[w:Pangloss|Pangloss]], a character in [[w:Voltaire|Voltaire]]’s ''[[w:Candide|Candide]]''.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{context|pejorative}} [[naively|Naively]] or [[unreasonably]] [[optimistic]].
#: ''Though he took a '''Panglossian''' view of the world in his youth, he became jaded as he grew older.''
# {{context|pejorative}} Of or relating to the view that this is the best of all possible worlds.

